            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1SA.31.1+1SA.31.2+1SA.31.3+1SA.31.4+1SA.31.5+1SA.31.6+1SA.31.7+1SA.31.8+1SA.31.9+1SA.31.10+1SA.31.11+1SA.31.12+1SA.31.13"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Sam 31:1-13",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nukw Abafilisitiya batera Abisirayeli, Abisirayeli barabahunga, bahindikirana ku musozi Gilibowa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.10.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.10.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 10:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abafilisitiya bakinagiza Sauli n’abahungu biwe, bica Yonatani na Abinadabu na Milikishuwa abahungu biwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.10.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.10.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 10:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Urugamba rusugereza Sauli, abanyamiheto bamushingiriza imyampi, bamurandura umutima. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.10.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.10.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 10:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maze Sauli abarira ūmutwaje ibirwanishwa, ati Sokōra inkota, uyinsogote, zirya ntakebga zoye kunshikīra, ngo zinshinyagurire. Arik’ ūmutwaje ibirwanishwa aranka, kuko yari yagize ubgoba bginshi. Sauli ni kwo gufata iyiwe nkota, ayīsukako. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.10.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.10.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 10:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uno yamutwaza ibirwanishwa abonye ko Sauli apfuye, na we yīsuka kuri rwiwe, arapfa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.10.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.10.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 10:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2SA.9.3"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Sam 9:3",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uko ni ko Sauli yapfuye, n’abahungu biwe batatu, n’ab’ inzu yiwe bose, bagwa hamwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.10.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.10.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 10:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maz’ ingabo zose z’Abisirayeli zari mu mwonga zibonye ko bahunze, kandi ko Sauli n’abahungu biwe bapfuye, bata ibisagara vyabo, barahunga; Abafilisitiya baraza, baravyinjira.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.10.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.10.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 10:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.10.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.10.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 10:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bukeye bgaho, Abafilisitiya baje gukoba imivyimba, basanga Sauli n’abahungu biwe barambaraye ku musozi Gilibowa bapfuye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.10.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.10.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 10:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baramukoba, bajana umutwe wiwe n’ibirwanishwa vyiwe, batuma intumwa mu gihugu c’Abafilisitiya iyo kiva kikagera, ngo bakwize inkuru mu bigirwamana vyabo no mu bantu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.10.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.10.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 10:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ibirwanishwa vyiwe babishira mu rusengero rw’ibigirwamana vyabo, umutwe wiwe bawumanika mu ngoro ya Dagoni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.10.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.10.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 10:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maz’ ab’i Yabeshi‐gileyadi bose bumvise ivyo Abafilisitiya bagiriye Sauli vyose, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.10.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.10.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 10:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "abahizi bose barahaguruka, bakūrah’ umuvyimba wa Sauli bo n’iy’ abahungu biwe, bayijana i Yabeshi, bahamba amagufa yabo musi y’igiti c’ umweloni i Yabeshi nyene, baca barisonzesha kumara imisi ndwi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.10.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.10.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 10:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
